  {"evidence":{"distinct":20,"float":{"applicable":true,"finiteRate":1.0,"plausibleAbsMax":null,"plausibleAbsMin":null,"plausibleRate":0.0},"maxSigned":14457,"maxUnsigned":14457,"minSigned":15,"minUnsigned":15,"negativeCount":0,"nonZeroCount":872,"rows":872,"string":{"applicable":true,"blockCoverageRate":0.343134,"blockSize":14863,"controlCharOffsets":0,"distinctOffsets":20,"meanDecodedLength":254.0,"nonEmptyOffsets":19,"utf8DecodableOffsets":20,"validOffsetRate":1.0},"zeroCount":0},"index":20,"inferred":"string","name":"f20","samples":["Stitch cloth into bandages and antidotes to heal injuries and remove poisons. Bandages are supplemental to (but not replacing) magical means of healing. Heroes with limited healing capabilities may find great benefit from being skilled in First Aid.","Forge metals and ore found by Mining into deadly weapons, mail armor, plate armor, and other similar items. Blacksmiths (particularly those that equip heavy armor) are able to outfit themselves, guildmates, or sell their creations via the Auction House.\n\nAdvanced Blacksmiths may also specialize further into Armorsmithing or Weaponsmithing.","Refine leather, hide and scales found via Skinning into medium armors - leather and mail - as well as cloaks, bags and unique embroideries improving equipment. Leatherworkers may outfit themselves and others with suitable armors, as well as proft from selling their creations via the Auction House.\n\nAdvanced Leatherworkers may specialize in Dragonscale, Elemental, or Tribal leatherworking.","Combine herbs found by Herbalism into brews that produce a variety of - mostly - positive effects, or Transmute rare materials. With their power to create valuable consumables, Alchemists are highly useful to guilds. Alchemists can also make a great deal of money via the Auction House.\n\nAdvanced Alchemists may also specialize further into Elixirs, Potions, or Transmutation.","Harvest potent herbs found throughout the world, which can be transformed by other professions' - mostly Alchemy or Inscription - recipes. Materials gathered by Herbalist can provide reagents to guildmates, or they may sell their gatherings via the Auction House."],"width":4},
